    ck(f"{v9:→<170}", "-170141183460469231731687303715884105728→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→→", 11, "i128 big {→<170}")
    ck(f"{v10}", "-170141183460469231731687303715884105727", 11, "i128 big {}")
    ck(f"{v10:+}", "-170141183460469231731687303715884105727", 11, "i128 big {+}")
    ck(f"{v10:60}", "                    -170141183460469231731687303715884105727", 11, "i128 big {60}")
